// Fosved Office v2 — OSP Dispatcher (NATIVE v4.0)
// Full strategic analysis engine: 23 SPD skills (3 tiers) + domain classification
// + depth routing + Tavily/Telegram search + structured analysis modes
// + verification + calibration + Brier score computation
// + PROJECT PARAMS: per-phase token budgets, depth→model mapping, auto-escalation,
//   12 programmatic quality gates, API endpoints, error categories + fallback, JSON schemas
// + FORCES FORMULA: P = A × R × S × L × E × E_modifier (native computation)
// + SHERMAN KENT: verbal-to-numeric probability scale (native mapping)
// + LIFECYCLE: drafted→published→watching→verified/missed/partial/superseded
// + CROSS-DEPT: Finance+OSP, Expert+OSP, LZ+OSP, Legal+OSP routing
// + DISCLAIMER: top + bottom + final safety check (no investment advice)
// + DB SCHEMA: inline SQL DDL from schema-v4.1.prisma (15 models)
// Sources: Fosved_v4_1_Transition_Pack (SPD→OSP), library/osp.md v3.0, 23 skill SKILL.md

