// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// UPRAVLENIE ROUTING — cross-department coordination
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// OSP → Finance: verify financial implications of strategic forecast
//   trigger: asymmetric bet involving financial instruments
//   pattern: OSPRouteToFinance(thesis, forecast)
// OSP → Expert: prepare briefing for owner meeting
//   trigger: depth >= 3 analysis + upcoming meeting
//   pattern: OSPRouteToExpert(analysis_id, meeting_context)
// OSP → LZ: technology assessment for strategic analysis
//   trigger: tech disruption impact on forecast
//   pattern: OSPRouteToLZ(technology, question)
// OSP → Legal: regulatory implications of strategic position
//   trigger: sanction/regulatory impact on forecast
//   pattern: OSPRouteToLegal(thesis, jurisdiction)
// Finance → OSP: validate financial data used in strategic analysis
//   trigger: Finance department detects data quality issue
//   pattern: FinanceValidateOSPData(analysis_id, data_point)
